@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Bao Minh, Property All Risks rules (the document's own title, src:1-2), row VN-08.
-- THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every rule module imports this one.
--
-- Source: ../../source/raw/baominh-par.txt, the `pdftotext -layout` rendering of
-- 01-QuytacBHMoiruirotaisan_TV.pdf (sha256 cd83ace0...b987c5), retrieved 2026-10-06 from
-- baominh.com.vn. A `src:N` comment quotes line N of that rendering; every one of them was
-- generated by tools/vnsrc.py, none was typed.
--
-- Money is Vietnamese dong (VND), a bare NUMBER. Dates are calendar dates (IMPORT daydate).
-- Membership test for this module: a witness of ordinary competence (the Insured, a loss
-- adjuster, the Schedule itself) could testify to the fact. Whether the fact makes anything
-- payable is a rule, and belongs in the module for the clause that says so.
-- src:1 | QUY TẮC
-- src:2 | BẢO HIỂM MỌI RỦI RO CHO TÀI SẢN
-- src:4 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm số ………………………

§ `Nouns for the Bao Minh property all risks rules`

§§ `The parties and what they do`

-- "Bao Minh" is the insurer's short name in the document (src:8-9). The document also says
-- "the insurer" (Người bảo hiểm) three times without defining it (src:361, 420, 453); this
-- encoding reads both as the same party (GLOSSARY.md).
DECLARE `A party` IS ONE OF
    `the Insured`
    `the Insurer`

-- The acts the regulative rules in the conditions module name. Each is quoted at the rule.
DECLARE `An act` IS ONE OF
    `take all necessary measures to minimise the loss and recover lost property`  -- GC 9(a)(i)
    `notify the Insurer in writing`                                              -- GC 9(a)(ii)
    `notify the police`                                                          -- GC 9(a)(iii)
    `submit a written claim listing the items and amounts`                       -- GC 9(b)(i)
    `give particulars of other insurances`                                       -- GC 9(b)(ii)
    `appoint an arbitrator in writing`                                           -- GC 7

§§ `The Schedule`

-- The document leaves the particulars of each policy to the Schedule, which it calls the
-- "Bản tóm lược hợp đồng bảo hiểm" (src:7, 14, 23, 24, 258), once "Bản tóm lược bảo hiểm"
-- (src:152-153) and twice "Bản tóm lược hợp đồng" (src:256, 411). General Condition 1
-- (src:255-259, quoted in the conditions module) makes it part of the contract. Everything in
-- it is an input with no default.

-- One item of insured property listed in the Schedule with its own sum insured (src:22-23).
DECLARE `An item in the Schedule` HAS
    `description`                                         IS A STRING
    `sum insured`                                         IS A NUMBER
    `already paid on this item in the period of insurance` IS A NUMBER

-- A period: the period of insurance, or a renewal period (src:13-15).
DECLARE `A period` HAS
    `first day` IS A DATE
    `last day`  IS A DATE

-- A limit of liability stated in the Schedule (src:24). What a limit applies to (one item, one
-- peril, one event) is the Schedule's business: the record carries only the limits that apply
-- to the loss in question, and what has already been paid against each.
DECLARE `A limit of liability` HAS
    `description`                  IS A STRING
    `amount`                       IS A NUMBER
    `already paid against it`      IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `The Schedule` HAS
    `policy number`                                   IS A STRING      -- src:4, a blank in the form
    `the period of insurance`                         IS A `A period`
    `renewal periods paid for and accepted`           IS A LIST OF `A period`
    -- the items as the Schedule lists them; each damaged item carries its own entry
    `the items`                                       IS A LIST OF `An item in the Schedule`
    `the total sum insured`                           IS A NUMBER
    `already paid under this policy in the period`    IS A NUMBER
    `the limits of liability`                         IS A LIST OF `A limit of liability`
    -- NOTHING means the Schedule states no deductible (GC 13 deducts only what it states).
    `the deductible for each loss`                    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `the annual premium`                              IS A NUMBER
    `the premium for the period`                      IS A NUMBER
    `the Insured has paid or agreed to pay the premium` IS A BOOLEAN   -- src:7-8

§§ `Causes`

-- Every cause the document names, one constructor per noun as the document lists it, in the
-- order it first names them, with the clause where it is named. Where two clauses name what
-- may be one peril in different words, they are kept apart: "biểu tình" in exclusion 6 and
-- "bạo loạn" in exclusion 11; "đâm va với các phương tiện giao thông" and "xe cộ đâm va". The
-- document chose different words, and the difference is a finding in NOTES.md, not something
-- to repair here.
DECLARE `A cause` IS ONE OF
    -- Exclusion 1(a)(i)
    `faulty design`
    `defective material`
    `defective workmanship`
    `latent defect`
    `gradual deterioration`
    `deformation`
    `wear and tear from use`
    -- Exclusion 1(a)(ii)
    `interruption of the water supply to or from the insured premises`
    `interruption of the gas supply to or from the insured premises`
    `interruption of the electricity supply to or from the insured premises`
    `interruption of the fuel system to or from the insured premises`
    `failure of the waste disposal system to or from the insured premises`
    -- Exclusion 1(b)(i)
    `collapse of an insured building`
    `cracking of an insured building`
    -- Exclusion 1(b)(ii)
    corrosion
    rust
    `extreme or changing temperature, humidity or dryness of the weather`
    rot
    mould
    shrinkage
    evaporation
    `loss of weight`
    `change of colour, flavour, texture or finish`
    `the action of light`
    vermin
    insects
    scratching
    -- Exclusion 1(c)
    theft                                                                       -- (i)
    `a fraudulent or dishonest act`                                             -- (ii)
    `unexplained disappearance`                                                 -- (iii)
    `inventory shortage`                                                        -- (iii)
    `an unknown cause`                                                          -- (iii)
    `an error in recording information`                                         -- (iii)
    `a shortage in the supply or delivery of materials`                         -- (iii)
    `an administrative or accounting error`                                     -- (iii)
    `cracking, fracture, collapse or overheating of a boiler, economiser, vessel or pipe` -- (iv)
    `leakage of a boiler weld`                                                  -- (iv)
    `mechanical or electrical breakdown or derangement of machinery or equipment` -- (v)
    `bursting, overflowing or leaking of water tanks, pipes or apparatus`       -- (vi), and exclusion 6
    -- Exclusion 1(d)
    `erosion by river or sea`                                                   -- (i)
    subsidence                                                                  -- (ii)
    heave                                                                       -- (ii)
    landslip                                                                    -- (ii)
    `normal settlement or bedding down of new structures`                       -- (iii)
    wind                                                                        -- (iv)
    rain                                                                        -- (iv)
    hail                                                                        -- (iv), and exclusion 11
    frost                                                                       -- (iv)
    snow                                                                        -- (iv)
    flood                                                                       -- (iv)
    sand                                                                        -- (iv)
    dust                                                                        -- (iv)
    `solidification by cold`                                                    -- (v)
    `escape of molten metal`                                                    -- (v)
    -- Exclusion 2
    `a malicious act of the Insured or of anyone acting for the Insured`        -- (a)
    `wilful negligence of the Insured or of anyone acting for the Insured`      -- (a)
    `cessation of work`                                                         -- (b)
    delay                                                                       -- (b)
    `loss of market`                                                            -- (b)
    `consequential loss of any other kind`                                      -- (b)
    -- Exclusion 3
    war                                                                         -- (a)
    invasion                                                                    -- (a)
    `act of a foreign enemy`                                                    -- (a)
    hostilities                                                                 -- (a)
    `warlike operations`                                                        -- (a)
    `civil war`                                                                 -- (a)
    mutiny                                                                      -- (b)
    `civil commotion amounting to or forming part of a popular rising`          -- (b)
    `military rising`                                                           -- (b)
    insurrection                                                                -- (b)
    rebellion                                                                   -- (b)
    revolution                                                                  -- (b)
    `military or usurped power`                                                 -- (b)
    `an act of force or violence, or a threat of it`                            -- (c), classified by `An act of force or violence`
    `confiscation, nationalisation or requisition by order of a lawful public authority` -- d)(i)
    `unlawful occupation of a building by any person`                           -- d)(ii)
    `destruction by order of a public authority`                                -- (e)
    `action taken to control, prevent or suppress an event in exclusion 3(a) to (c)` -- extension
    -- Exclusion 4
    `nuclear weapons material`                                                  -- (a)
    `ionising radiation or radioactive contamination from nuclear fuel or nuclear waste` -- (b)(i)
    `the radioactive, explosive or other hazardous properties of a nuclear explosive device` -- (b)(ii)
    -- Exclusion 5
    `pollution or contamination`
    -- Exclusion 6, the perils written back
    fire                                                                        -- also 10(a)(ii), 11
    explosion                                                                   -- also 10(a)(ii), 11
    lightning                                                                   -- also 11
    `falling aircraft`                                                          -- also 11
    strike                                                                      -- also 11
    demonstration                                                               -- biểu tình
    `workers taking part in a lockout`
    `persons taking part in a labour dispute`
    `a malicious act of another person`
    `impact by road vehicles or animals`
    earthquake                                                                  -- also 11
    `sea storm`                                                                 -- bão biển
    `storm flood`                                                               -- bão lụt
    -- Exclusion 8(f) to (h)
    `a drying process or a process using heat`                                  -- 8(f)
    `installing or moving the machinery or equipment, including dismantling and re-erecting it` -- 8(g)
    `the repair, inspection, installation or maintenance work`                  -- 8(h)
    -- Exclusion 10 (pressure vessels)
    `explosion or rupture of the boiler, vessel, machine or apparatus itself`
    -- Exclusion 10 (electronic data)
    `loss, damage, destruction, distortion, erasure, corruption or alteration of electronic data`
    `a computer virus`
    -- Exclusion 11, Part 1
    `processing of data involving a change of date, by a computer system or chip`  -- a.
    `a change or modification involving a change of date, to a computer system or chip` -- b.
    -- Exclusion 11, the perils written back (fire, lightning, explosion, falling aircraft,
    -- hail, strike and earthquake are above)
    `impact by vehicles`                                                        -- xe cộ đâm va
    `falling objects`
    windstorm                                                                   -- giông bão
    whirlwind                                                                   -- lốc xóay
    riot                                                                        -- bạo loạn
    `civil commotion`                                                           -- dân biến
    hooliganism                                                                 -- hành vi côn đồ
    `acts of sabotage`                                                          -- hành động phá hoại
    `volcanic eruption`
    tsunami
    freezing
    `the weight of ice and snow`
    -- Anything else
    `a cause not named in this document`

-- One link in the chain of causation of the Damage to one item, as an adjuster would record it.
-- `direct`: the cause acted directly on the item (the document distinguishes "trực tiếp hoặc
-- gián tiếp", directly or indirectly, at src:41, 76, 111, 198, 218). NOTES.md fork F3 says which
-- exclusions reach only direct causes.
-- `resulting from earlier Damage by`: where this cause itself followed from earlier Damage to the
-- insured property or the building containing it, the cause of that earlier Damage. The
-- write-backs of exclusions 1(b) and 1(c) (src:41-43, 62-63) and of exclusion 5 (src:122-123)
-- turn on it.
DECLARE `A link in the chain of causation` HAS
    `the cause`                        IS A `A cause`
    `direct`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `resulting from earlier Damage by` IS A MAYBE `A cause`

-- Exclusion 3(c) defines "khủng bố" (terrorism). Its elements are facts about the act:
-- src:84 | Theo loại trừ 3 (c) này, “khủng bố” có nghĩa là một hành động, bao gồm nhưng không giới
-- src:85 | hạn việc sử dụng bạo lực hoặc vũ lực và/hoặc đe dọa dùng bạo lực, vũ lực của một người
-- src:86 | hoặc một nhóm người, hành động tự thân hoặc đại diện hoặc có liên quan đến bất kỳ tổ chức
-- src:87 | hoặc chính quyền nào cho các mục đích chính trị, tôn giáo, hệ tư tưởng hoặc các mục đích
-- src:88 | tương tự, kể cả việc sử dụng bạo lực mhằm gây hoang mang lo sợ cho công chúng hoặc một
-- src:89 | bộ phận công chúng.
DECLARE `An act of force or violence` HAS
    `use of force or violence, or a threat of it, by a person or a group of persons` IS A BOOLEAN
    `for a political, religious, ideological or similar purpose`                    IS A BOOLEAN

-- Exclusion 1(c)(i): theft is excluded unless both facts hold.
-- src:48 | (c) (i) trộm cắp, trừ khi việc trộm cắp đó xảy ra trong tòa nhà được bảo hiểm và kèm theo
-- src:49 | việc sử dụng vũ lực hoặc bạo lực để đột nhập hoặc tẩu thóat;
DECLARE `The circumstances of a theft` HAS
    `in the insured building`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `with force or violence to break in or to get out` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Exclusion 3 d), the proviso at src:98-100: when the Damage happened, relative to the
-- dispossession.
DECLARE `When the Damage happened, relative to a dispossession` IS ONE OF
    `before the dispossession`
    `during a temporary dispossession`
    `during or after a permanent dispossession`

§§ `Kinds of property`

-- Every kind of property the exclusions name, one constructor per noun, with the clause.
DECLARE `A kind of property` IS ONE OF
    -- Exclusion 6(a)
    money
    cheques
    stamps
    `securities of any kind`
    deeds
    `credit cards`
    `precious jewellery`
    `precious stones`
    `precious metals`
    bullion
    furs
    antiques
    `works of art`
    -- Exclusion 6(b)
    `fixed glass`
    -- Exclusion 6(c)
    `glass other than fixed glass`
    china
    earthenware
    marble
    `other fragile articles`
    -- Exclusion 6(d)
    `electronic equipment`
    computers
    `data processing equipment`
    -- Exclusion 7
    `goods on consignment`
    `goods held in trust`
    documents
    manuscripts
    `business books`
    `computer data systems`
    samples
    moulds
    `design drawings`
    explosives
    -- Exclusion 8(a)
    `motor vehicles licensed for public roads, with their equipment and accessories`
    `tractor vehicles`
    trailers
    trains
    locomotives
    `rolling stock`
    ships
    aircraft
    spacecraft
    `similar conveyances`
    -- Exclusion 8(d)
    `land, including topsoil, fill, drainage and culverts`
    `driveways to buildings`
    pavements
    runways
    `railway lines`
    dams
    reservoirs                                     -- bể chứa: also "tanks" in exclusion 6
    canals
    rigs
    wells
    pipelines                                      -- đường ống: also "pipes" in 1(c)(vi) and 6
    tunnels
    bridges
    docks
    breakwaters
    piers
    excavations
    wharves
    mines
    `underground property`
    `offshore property`
    -- Exclusion 8(e)
    livestock
    crops
    trees
    -- Exclusion 10 (pressure vessels)
    boilers
    `pressure economisers`
    turbines
    `other vessels, machinery or apparatus using pressure`
    -- Exclusion 10 (electronic data)
    `electronic data`
    `electronic data processing media`
    -- Exclusion 1(d)(iv)
    gates
    fences
    -- Property no exclusion names by its kind
    buildings
    `machinery and equipment`
    stock
    `other property`

§§ `One item of property damaged in the loss`

-- The circumstances of the item when the loss happened. Each is a fact an adjuster records.
DECLARE `The circumstances of the item` HAS
    `at the insured premises`                                        IS A BOOLEAN  -- src:12
    `movable`                                                        IS A BOOLEAN  -- 1(d)(iv)
    `in the open or in a building without walls`                     IS A BOOLEAN  -- 1(d)(iv)
    `stated as insured in this policy`                               IS A BOOLEAN  -- 6(a), 7
    `in transit outside the insured premises`                        IS A BOOLEAN  -- 8(b)
    `in the course of demolition, construction or erection, or materials supplied for it` IS A BOOLEAN -- 8(c)
    `being installed or moved`                                       IS A BOOLEAN  -- 8(g)
    `undergoing repair, inspection, installation or maintenance`     IS A BOOLEAN  -- 8(h)
    `insured in some other way`                                      IS A BOOLEAN  -- 8(i)
    `insured, or such that it would have to be insured, under a marine policy` IS A BOOLEAN -- 9

-- Exclusion 10(b) valuation of electronic data processing media, where they are the item.
DECLARE `The costs of electronic data processing media` HAS
    `the cost of blank media`                                         IS A NUMBER
    `the cost of copying the data from back-up or from the originals` IS A NUMBER
    `the media are repaired, replaced or restored`                    IS A BOOLEAN

-- The money facts about the item. Each MAYBE is needed only in some cases, and a rule that
-- needs one that is NOTHING refuses, naming it.
DECLARE `The valuation of the item` HAS
    -- src:16-17: the value of the property at the time of the loss, or the value of the part
    -- damaged. This is the measure of the Damage before any condition is applied.
    `the Damage, valued at the time of the loss`                      IS A NUMBER
    -- exclusions 1(a), 1(c), 8(h): "phần Tổn hại phát sinh từ các nguyên nhân đó"
    `the part of the Damage arising from a cause not excluded`        IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    -- GC 14: "giá trị thực tế" at the time of the damage
    `the actual value of the item at the time of the loss`            IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    -- GC 6: the sum insured of each other policy covering the same property or loss
    `sums insured by other insurances of the same property or loss`   IS A LIST OF NUMBER
    -- exclusion 9: what the marine policy would pay if this policy did not exist
    `the amount the marine policy would pay if this policy did not exist` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    -- exclusion 10(b)
    `the costs of the media`                                          IS A MAYBE `The costs of electronic data processing media`

-- GC 2, the three limbs, each as it affects this item.
-- src:262 | 2. MÔ TẢ SAI
-- src:263 | Nếu Người được bảo hiểm hoặc đại diện của Người được bảo hiểm cung cấp thông tin sai lệch có
-- src:264 | liên quan đến tài sản được bảo hiểm, tòa nhà hoặc kiến trúc chứa tài sản được bảo hiểm, công việc
-- src:265 | kinh doanh hoặc cơ sở được bảo hiểm hoặc có bất kỳ sự khai báo sai lệch các thông tin quan trọng
-- src:266 | hoặc quên khai báo các thông tin mà dựa vào đó Bảo Minh đánh giá rủi ro thì Bảo Minh sẽ không
-- src:267 | chịu trách nhiệm bồi thường đối với các tổn hại tài sản bị ảnh hưởng bởi các thông báo sai lệch
-- src:268 | hoặc quên sót đó.
DECLARE `What the Insured told the Insurer about the item` HAS
    `false information about the property, the building, the business or the premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a misstatement of a material fact`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `an omission of a fact on which the Insurer assessed the risk`          IS A BOOLEAN

-- GC 8, the four changes. Each change that affects the item is recorded with whether the
-- Insurer accepted it by endorsement before the loss.
DECLARE `A change under General Condition 8` IS ONE OF
    `a change of the Insured's business or manufacture`                     -- (a), first limb
    `a change of occupation or other circumstances that increases the likelihood of loss` -- (a), second limb
    `the building or premises left unattended` HAS `for days` IS A NUMBER   -- (b)
    `removal to a place this policy does not cover`                         -- (c)
    `a transfer of the Insured's interest` HAS `by will or by operation of law` IS A BOOLEAN -- (d)

DECLARE `A change affecting the item` HAS
    `the change`                                IS A `A change under General Condition 8`
    `accepted by endorsement before the loss`   IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `A damaged item` HAS
    `the item insured`                IS AN `An item in the Schedule`
    `kind`                            IS A `A kind of property`
    `the chain of causation`          IS A LIST OF `A link in the chain of causation`
    `circumstances`                   IS A `The circumstances of the item`
    `valuation`                       IS A `The valuation of the item`
    `what the Insured told the Insurer` IS A `What the Insured told the Insurer about the item`
    `changes under General Condition 8` IS A LIST OF `A change affecting the item`
    -- exclusion 11, Part 2 (src:239-244): the amount claimed is a cost of changing or adding to
    -- a computer system, hardware, programme, software or chip
    `claimed as a cost of changing or adding to a computer system, programme, software or chip` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `The loss`

-- GC 9, as the Insured performed it. Days are counted from the day the Insured became aware
-- of the incident (src:335).
DECLARE `The claims procedure as performed` HAS
    -- (a)(i)-(iii) say "ngay lập tức" (immediately), which the document does not quantify: these
    -- are judgements a loss adjuster or a court makes on the facts (fork F17).
    `measures to minimise the loss were taken immediately`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `written notice was given to the Insurer immediately`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the police were notified immediately`                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    -- (b): NOTHING where the written claim has not been submitted
    `days from awareness to the written claim`                                   IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    -- (b): "hoặc lâu hơn tùy theo sự đồng ý bằng văn bản của Bảo Minh"; NOTHING where none agreed
    `a longer period agreed in writing by the Insurer, in days`                  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `particulars of other insurances were given`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the information and documents the Insurer reasonably required were provided, with a declaration of truth` IS A BOOLEAN

-- The Insured's conduct that the general conditions make operative.
DECLARE `The Insured's conduct` HAS
    `the claim is fraudulent in some respect`                                    IS A BOOLEAN -- GC 4(a)
    `fraudulent means or devices were used to obtain a benefit`                  IS A BOOLEAN -- GC 4(a)
    `refused an act the Insurer required to enforce its rights against others`   IS A BOOLEAN -- GC 5
    `did not comply with a requirement of the Insurer under General Condition 10` IS A BOOLEAN -- GC 10
    `hindered the Insurer in exercising its powers under General Condition 10`   IS A BOOLEAN -- GC 10
    `did not provide the plans and information required for a reinstatement`   IS A BOOLEAN -- GC 11
    `maintained the property properly`                                           IS A BOOLEAN -- GC 12
    `took every precaution to prevent loss`                                      IS A BOOLEAN -- GC 12
    `insured the deductible elsewhere`                                           IS A BOOLEAN -- GC 13
    `the claims procedure`                                                       IS A `The claims procedure as performed`

-- GC 15, the premium payment warranty.
-- `date the cover was accepted` renders "ngày chấp nhận bảo hiểm" (src:424, 436).
DECLARE `The premium payment` HAS
    `the Insurer accepted payment by instalments`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the cover was accepted`                          IS A DATE
    -- the premium, or under instalments the first instalment, paid in full; NOTHING if not paid
    `date the premium was paid in full`                    IS A MAYBE DATE
    -- instalments only: the agreed date of the first later instalment not paid on that date;
    -- NOTHING where every later instalment was paid on its agreed date
    `agreed date of the first later instalment not paid on time` IS A MAYBE DATE

-- An endorsement (sửa đổi bổ sung), for the GC 15 dates.
DECLARE `An endorsement` HAS
    `date the cover in it takes effect` IS A DATE
    `date it was issued`                IS A DATE

DECLARE `A loss` HAS
    `date of the loss`                                  IS A DATE
    `physical loss, destruction or damage`              IS A BOOLEAN   -- src:17-18
    `sudden and unforeseen`                             IS A BOOLEAN   -- src:18, "có tính bất ngờ"
    `the damaged items`                                 IS A LIST OF `A damaged item`
    -- each needed only when the chain of causation names the cause it is about
    `the theft`                                         IS A MAYBE `The circumstances of a theft`
    `the act of force or violence`                      IS A MAYBE `An act of force or violence`
    `when the Damage happened, relative to the dispossession` IS A MAYBE `When the Damage happened, relative to a dispossession`
    `the insured building was empty or not in use`      IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `theft or a malicious act was suspected`            IS A BOOLEAN   -- GC 9(a)(iii)
    `the Insured's conduct`                             IS A `The Insured's conduct`
    `the premium payment`                               IS A `The premium payment`

§§ `What the conditions make of the claim`

-- The answer for a claim, as a total result with the outcome the document names in each case.
DECLARE `The answer for a claim` IS ONE OF
    `nothing is payable because` HAS `the reasons` IS A LIST OF STRING
    `the Insurer must pay`       HAS `the amount`  IS A NUMBER

-- What the exclusions do to one item.
DECLARE `The effect of the exclusions on an item` IS ONE OF
    `no exclusion applies`
    `excluded by`                                                   HAS `the clauses` IS A LIST OF STRING
    `excluded except for the part arising from a cause not excluded` HAS `the clauses` IS A LIST OF STRING

-- The rows of the short-period scale in GC 3 (src:276-281).
DECLARE `A row of the short-period scale` HAS
    `the period, as printed`                    IS A STRING
    `months, from more than`                    IS A NUMBER
    -- NOTHING for the last row, "Trên 9 tháng", which has no upper bound
    `months, up to and including`               IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `the percentage of the annual premium kept` IS A NUMBER
